//< A `##lint(...)`'s code is checked against the canonical source, ksplc/base/lint_codes.kspls
//<
//< Unmatched, a misspelling such as `##lint(I004 = off)` is silently void, so a suppression
//< believed in place is not. An unknown code must not pass with zero diagnostics
//< (ksplc/docs/DESIGN.md §13.1).
// EXPECT: unknown diagnostic code 'I004'
// EXPECT: unknown lint level 'maybe'
##lint(I004 = off)
##lint(I0305 = maybe)

fn main() {}
